an-dalal#person\",\"name\":\"Ketan Dalal\",\"url\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/ketan-dalal\",\"jobTitle\":\"Independent, Non-Executive Director\",\"worksFor\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/#organization\"}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/ben-druskin#person\",\"name\":\"Ben Druskin\",\"url\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/ben-druskin\",\"jobTitle\":\"Independent, Non-Executive Director\",\"worksFor\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/#organization\"}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":6,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/radha-rajappa#person\",\"name\":\"Radha Rajappa\",\"url\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/radha-rajappa\",\"jobTitle\":\"Independent, Non-Executive Director\",\"worksFor\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/#organization\"}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":7,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/u-b-pravin-rao#person\",\"name\":\"U. B. Pravin Rao\",\"url\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/u-b-pravin-rao\",\"jobTitle\":\"Independent, Non-Executive Director\",\"worksFor\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/#organization\"}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":8,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/vijayasimha-alilughatta#person\",\"name\":\"Vijayasimha (Vijay) Alilughatta\",\"url\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/vijayasimha-alilughatta\",\"jobTitle\":\"Chief Operating Officer\",\"worksFor\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/#organization\"}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":9,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/vivek-ranjan#person\",\"name\":\"Vivek Ranjan\",\"url\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/vivek-ranjan\",\"jobTitle\":\"Chief Human Resources Officer\",\"worksFor\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/#organization\"}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":10,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/pulkit-bhandari#person\",\"name\":\"Pulkit Bhandari\",\"url\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/pulkit-bhandari\",\"jobTitle\":\"Chief Financial Officer\",\"worksFor\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/#organization\"}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":11,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/parag-jain#person\",\"name\":\"Parag Jain\",\"url\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/parag-jain\",\"jobTitle\":\"Executive Vice President and Head - Manufacturing and Consumer Services, and Growth Office\",\"worksFor\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/#organization\"}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":12,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/nachiketa-mitra#person\",\"name\":\"Nachiketa (Nachi) Mitra\",\"url\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/nachiketa-mitra\",\"jobTitle\":\"Executive Vice President and Head - Banking and Financial Services\",\"worksFor\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/#organization\"}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":13,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/harish-lala#person\",\"name\":\"Harish Lala\",\"url\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/harish-lala\",\"jobTitle\":\"Executive Vice President and Head - Telecommunication, Media, and Technology\",\"worksFor\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/#organization\"}}},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":14,\"item\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/chaitanya-rajebahadur#person\",\"name\":\"Chaitanya (Chai) Rajebahadur\",\"url\":\"https://www.zensar.com/about-us/leadership/chaitanya-rajebahadur\",\"jobTitle\":\"EVP and Global Leader - Digital Engineering, Consulting, Martech, AI, and Creative Studios\",